      Data: 152|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Dialog shown after a win once the player confirms the higher-or-lower
        offer on the confirm canvas. Leave unassigned to disable the feature and
        pay out immediately as before. Expects a Cards/HiLoCardAnchorA/HiLoCardA
        and Cards/HiLoCardAnchorB/HiLoCardB pair of cards inside - one dealt face
        up, one face down - plus HiLoPickA/HiLoPickB interact zones over them whose
        GameInteract Solitaire claims for _OnHiLoPickA/_OnHiLoPickB, so the player
        picks the card they think is higher. While a round is live the start/quit
        button is disabled and the dialog's own controls answer; after a lost round
        the dialog stays up but the button is enabled again, and one press settles
        it.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
