      Data: 158|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Question label at the top of the hi-lo dialog. Solitaire rewrites it
        per round: HI_LO_PICK while a round waits for a pick, HI_LO_WIN/HI_LO_TIE/HI_LO_LOSE
        once it is settled. Wired to the dialog''s Question label in the table prefabs;
        if unassigned, resolved from DoubleOrNothingDialog''s Panel/Question child
        in Start.'
