      Data: 161|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: YES/NO button row inside the hi-lo dialog, below the cards. Its buttons
        call _ConfirmNewGame/_CancelNewGame, which resolve the between-rounds continue
        question. Shown only while that question is pending (never after a lost round
        - that leaves the dialog up with the start/quit button as the way out). If
        unassigned, resolved from DoubleOrNothingDialog's Panel/Buttons child in
        Start.
