      Data: 174|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Optional test trigger for the higher-or-lower dialog: assign any GameInteract
        here (a copy of the undo button works) and Solitaire claims it in Start.
        While your own game is running it offers _DebugTriggerHiLo, which marks the
        game as completely finished (won) and then offers the higher-or-lower game,
        so the whole post-win flow can be tested without playing a game out. Leave
        unassigned for no debug button.'
